[[2047,31,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The two front fog lights \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (left) and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F16</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (right)\nare supplied through the fog lights relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               by the direct\nline from the battery - maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) up to\n2/99 or of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99. - and through the front fog light\nfuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B13</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99.</p><p>The signal which energizes the coil for\nthe relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               arrives from the integrated services control\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 11 of connector C) according to the enablement logic\ndescribed.</p><p>The control unit receives the signal that\nthe side lights are on from the switch for the steering column switch\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 8 of connector C) and the supply is controlled\nby the ignition (INT) from the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 7 of connector B).</p><p>When the engagement signal also arrives\nfrom the button \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 1 of connector B), the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               sends\nthe command to the front fog lights relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply line for the two fog lights also\nsends a signal to the rev counter module \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E15</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (pin 14 of connector\nB) to light up the &quot;front fog lights on&quot; warning light.</p><p>The switch \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H35</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is lit up when the\nside lights are switched on by means of the line coming from the\nswitch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p>"]]